{
  "caption_latex": "\\textbf{An error signal is not a benefit signal.} Each line shows one WaterDrop 100k model: the preceding observed residual score correlates with base error but weakly with the signed improvement under its actual Risk25 graph. This score is one observed step older than the current scores in Figure~\\ref{fig:residual-times}. All six models use 27 test trajectories and 11 observed histories per trajectory; frame correlations average within trajectory and seed. This diagnostic uses uncapped graphs without self-messages and is separate from the paired 110k continuation study.",
